flowchart LR
  subgraph Client[下位机]
    Sensors[传感器/BMS/RFID/PLC]
    ClientApp[采集与封装]
    Offline[离线缓存/降频策略]
  end
  Broker[MQTT Broker]
  subgraph Server[上位机]
    MqttIn[MQTT 消息分发]
    Ingest[解析/入库/告警/命令闭环]
    Retention[数据保留清理]
    DB[(MySQL)]
    MediaFS[(媒体文件存储)]
    API[HTTP API]
    GUI[GUI]
  end

  Sensors --> ClientApp
  ClientApp --> Offline --> Broker
  Broker --> MqttIn --> Ingest --> DB
  Ingest -.告警.-> Broker
  Ingest -.可选.-> MediaFS
  API --> Ingest
  GUI --> API
  Retention --> DB
  Ingest --> Retention
